sequenceDiagram
  actor C as Customer
  participant S as Supervisor
  participant CC as CustomerCareAgent
  participant G as ToolGateway
  participant TK as Ticketing
  C->>S: I want to complain about poor service
  S->>CC: handle
  CC->>G: ticket.create
  G->>G: consent case_processing? (default no)
  G-->>C: Need your permission. Reply I agree.
  C->>S: I agree
  S->>S: record consent, resume original request
  G-->>C: Confirm: register complaint? (single-use confirmation)
  C->>S: YES
  G->>TK: create (dedup within window, priority classified)
  TK-->>G: TCK-xxxx
  G-->>C: Reference TCK-xxxx and expected next step
  C->>S: Status of TCK-xxxx?
  CC->>G: ticket.get
  G-->>C: Status from ticketing system
